    {
      "v": 3,
      "zh": "我在这里，你们要在耶和华和他的受膏者面前给我作见证。我夺过谁的牛，抢过谁的驴，欺负过谁，虐待过谁，从谁手里受过贿赂因而眼瞎呢？若有，我必偿还。」",
      "en": "Here I am. Bring a charge against me before the Lord and before his chosen king.[NOTE:1] Whose ox have I taken? Whose donkey have I taken? Whom have I wronged? Whom have I oppressed? From whose hand have I taken a bribe so that I would overlook something? Tell me,[NOTE:2] and I will return it to you!”",
